flowchart TD
    Start([👤 Customer Needs Service]) --> Browse[🔍 Browse 8 Standard Trade Categories]
    Browse --> SelectSKU[🛠️ Select Verified Service & Addons]
    SelectSKU --> Checkout[💳 Escrow Payment via SSLCommerz Gateway]
    
    Checkout --> FundEscrow[(🔒 Funds Held in Escrow Account)]
    FundEscrow --> Dispatch[📡 Instant Dispatch to Nearby Verified Workers]
    
    Dispatch --> Accept{Worker Accepts?}
    Accept -- No --> ReRoute[🔄 Auto-Route to Next Nearest Specialist]
    ReRoute --> Dispatch
    
    Accept -- Yes --> EnRoute[🚗 Worker Dispatched & Live Location Tracked]
    EnRoute --> Arrive[📍 Worker Arrives at Customer Location]
    
    Arrive --> Handshake{🤝 4-Digit Arrival OTP Handshake}
    Handshake -- Invalid --> BlockTimer[⛔ Timer & Job Blocked]
    Handshake -- Verified --> InProgress[⏱️ Billable Job In-Progress]
    
    InProgress --> JobDone[📸 Worker Uploads Photo Proof & Marks Done]
    JobDone --> CustomerApproval{Customer Signs Off?}
    
    CustomerApproval -- Dispute --> Mediation[⚖️ Admin Dispute Mediation Desk]
    CustomerApproval -- Approved --> ReleaseEscrow[(🔓 Atomic Escrow Payout Released)]
    
    ReleaseEscrow --> PayoutWorker[💵 Worker Wallet Credited 90%]
    ReleaseEscrow --> PlatformFee[🏢 Platform Maintenance Retained 10%]
    PayoutWorker --> Review[⭐ Dual Rating & Review Exchange]
    Review --> Done([🎉 Service Order Completed])
